<title>JAPAN: Senshukai -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Senshukai -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 84.96		vs	   81.57</p>
<p> Operating	  185    million	  vs	    1.47</p>
<p> Current	    622    million	  vs	    1.80</p>
<p> Net		  387    million	  vs	  907    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.13 yen	  vs	   19.05 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     48 million	  vs	  48 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    8.00 yen</p>
<p> -Commem div	     -		vs	    1.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Senshukai Co Ltd is a sales firm, mainly involved in clothing and household utensils.</p>
</text>
